---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { label } from '../lib/i18n';
import { localeToLang } from '../lib/i18n';

const lang = localeToLang(Astro.currentLocale);

/** Live Score v2 weights — the stacked bar and the rows read from one source. */
const weights = [
  { key: 'valuation', pct: 25, tone: 'oklch(0.79 0.15 158)' },
  { key: 'growth', pct: 20, tone: 'oklch(0.75 0.12 158)' },
  { key: 'quality', pct: 20, tone: 'oklch(0.72 0.085 158)' },
  { key: 'size', pct: 15, tone: 'oklch(0.69 0.06 158)' },
  { key: 'entry', pct: 10, tone: 'oklch(0.66 0.035 158)' },
  { key: 'momentum', pct: 10, tone: 'var(--border)' },
] as const;

const weightDesc = {
  valuation: {
    ko: 'PER · PEG, FCF 수익률, PBR',
    en: 'P/E, PEG, FCF yield, P/B',
  },
  growth: {
    ko: '매출·이익 혼합 성장, 20~50% 스위트스팟 (50% 초과 페널티)',
    en: 'Blended revenue & earnings growth, 20–50% sweet spot (penalty above 50%)',
  },
  quality: {
    ko: 'ROE, 부채비율, 영업이익률, FCF/순이익, ROA',
    en: 'ROE, debt/equity, operating margin, FCF/net income, ROA',
  },
  size: {
    ko: '시총이 작을수록 가산 (한국 ≤2조 · 미국 ≤$20억 달러 구간 만점)',
    en: 'Smaller market cap scores higher (ideal ≤KRW 2T / ≤$2B)',
  },
  entry: {
    ko: '12개월 가격대 · 52주 고점 대비 (고점 근접 페널티)',
    en: '12-month price range and distance from 52-week high',
  },
  momentum: {
    ko: '6개월 수익률만 사용 (52주 고점 위치는 진입 축으로 이전, v1 대비 축소)',
    en: '6-month return only (52-week high position moved to Entry; reduced vs v1)',
  },
} as const;

const toc = [
  { id: 'goal', ko: '목표', en: 'Goal' },
  { id: 'rotation', ko: '시장 교대', en: 'Market rotation' },
  { id: 'weights', ko: '점수 구성 v2', en: 'Score weights v2' },
  { id: 'prefilter', ko: '1차 필터', en: 'Pre-filter' },
  { id: 'rules', ko: '선정·없음 규칙', en: 'Pick vs none' },
  { id: 'data', ko: '데이터·생성', en: 'Data & schedule' },
] as const;
---

<Layout title={label('methodology', lang)} titleKey="methodology" lang={lang}>
  <div class="doc-layout">
    <nav class="doc-toc" aria-label={label('contents', lang)}>
      {toc.map((item) => (
        <a href={`#${item.id}`}>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>{item.ko}</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>{item.en}</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <article class="doc-body">
      <h1 data-i18n="methodology">{label('methodology', lang)}</h1>
      <p>
        <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
          >규칙 기반 스크리닝으로 매일 1종목만 공개합니다. 확정 예측이 아니라 데이터와 점수에 따른
          후보 제시입니다.</span
        >
        <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
          >Rule-based screening publishes one pick per day — a data-and-score candidate, not a
          guaranteed forecast.</span
        >
      </p>

      <section id="goal">
        <h2>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>목표</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Goal</span>
        </h2>
        <p data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>
          향후 5년 내 시가 10배(텐베거) <strong>가능성</strong>이 높은 종목을 규칙 기반으로
          스크리닝합니다. Score v2는 피터 린치 GARP(저평가 성장주)와 Yartseva(2025) 멀티배거 연구를
          반영해 소형·FCF·지속 가능 성장·역발상 진입을 강조합니다.
        </p>
        <p data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>
          Screen for stocks with high <strong>potential</strong> for a 10x price move within five
          years. Score v2 blends Peter Lynch GARP heuristics with Yartseva (2025) multibagger factor
          research: size, cash yield, sustainable growth, and contrarian entry timing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="rotation">
        <h2>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>시장 교대</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Market rotation</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="market-split">
          <div>
            <p class="title">
              <span class="dot" style="background: var(--kr);"></span>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>홀수일 · 한국</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Odd days · Korea</span>
            </p>
            <p class="num">KOSPI · KOSDAQ ≈ 2,800</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="title">
              <span class="dot" style="background: var(--us);"></span>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>짝수일 · 미국</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Even days · US</span>
            </p>
            <p class="num">NYSE · NASDAQ ≈ 6,300</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
            >유니버스는 거래소 상장 종목 전체를 매일 갱신합니다. 스크리닝 전에 최근 30일 추천
            종목만 제외합니다.</span
          >
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
            >The universe is refreshed daily from full exchange listings. Only symbols recommended
            in the last 30 days are excluded before screening.</span
          >
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="weights">
        <div class="section-flag">
          <h2>
            <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>점수 구성 v2</span>
            <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Score weights v2</span>
          </h2>
          <span class="badge pick">
            <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>적용 중</span>
            <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Live</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="weight-bar" aria-hidden="true">
          {weights.map((w) => (
            <span style={`width: ${w.pct}%; background: ${w.tone};`}></span>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="weight-list">
          {weights.map((w) => (
            <div class="weight-row">
              <span class="name" data-i18n={w.key}>{label(w.key, lang)}</span>
              <span class="num pct" style={`color: ${w.tone};`}>{w.pct}%</span>
              <span class="desc">
                <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>{weightDesc[w.key].ko}</span>
                <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>{weightDesc[w.key].en}</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="prefilter">
        <h2>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>1차 필터</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Pre-filter</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="spec-table">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="key">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>한국 최소 시총</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>KR minimum cap</span>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="num">500억 원 / KRW 50B</span>
              <span class="muted">
                <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}> (목록에 시총이 없으면 포함)</span>
                <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}> (kept when cap data is missing)</span>
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="key">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>미국 최소 시총</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>US minimum cap</span>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span class="num">USD 300M</span>
              <span class="muted">
                <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}> (시총 데이터가 없으면 포함)</span>
                <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}> (kept when cap data is missing)</span>
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="key">Red flag</span>
            <span>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
                >자본잠식(B/M 음수) 또는 FCF·영업CF 동시 음수 종목은 제외</span
              >
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
                >Negative book equity, or both FCF and operating cash flow negative</span
              >
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="key">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>중복 제외</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Recency exclude</span>
            </span>
            <span>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>최근 30일 내 추천된 종목</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
                >Symbols recommended in the last 30 days</span
              >
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
            >애널리스트 커버리지가 낮은 종목에는 규모 점수에 소폭 가산합니다.</span
          >
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
            >Low analyst coverage receives a small size bonus.</span
          >
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="rules">
        <h2>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>선정·없음 규칙</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Pick vs none</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="rule-split">
          <div class="pick">
            <p class="num score" style="color: var(--accent);">≥ 70.0</p>
            <p class="label" data-i18n="pick">{label('pick', lang)}</p>
            <p class="hint">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>후보 중 최고 점수 1종목만 공개</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Highest scoring candidate only</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="none">
            <p class="num score" style="color: var(--faint);">&lt; 70.0</p>
            <p class="label muted" data-i18n="none">{label('none', lang)}</p>
            <p class="hint">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>기준을 만족할 때만 추천합니다</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Published only when criteria are met</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="data">
        <h2>
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>데이터·생성</span>
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Data & schedule</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="meta-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>생성 시각</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Schedule</span>
            </p>
            <p class="num">06:00 KST · GitHub Actions</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>저장</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Storage</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>DB 없음 · JSON을 Git에 커밋</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>No database · JSON committed to Git</span>
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>상장 목록</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Listings</span>
            </p>
            <p>FinanceDataReader</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}>가격·재무</span>
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}>Prices & fundamentals</span>
            </p>
            <p>
              <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
                >Yahoo Finance (yfinance) · 가격은 vendor 조정(분할·배당, auto_adjust=True).{' '}
                <a
                  href="https://github.com/jee1/ten_bagger/blob/main/docs/architecture/price-basis-validation-002780.md"
                  >002780.KS 가격 기준 검증 노트</a
                ></span
              >
              <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
                >Yahoo Finance (yfinance) · prices are vendor-adjusted (splits and dividends, auto_adjust=True).{' '}
                <a
                  href="https://github.com/jee1/ten_bagger/blob/main/docs/architecture/price-basis-validation-002780.md"
                  >002780.KS price-basis validation note</a
                ></span
              >
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          <span data-i18n-show="ko" hidden={lang !== 'ko'}
            >엔지니어링 노트 — Score v3 후보 팩터 · 측정 게이트 · GO/NO-GO 기록:{' '}
            <a
              href="https://github.com/jee1/ten_bagger/blob/main/docs/architecture/score-v3-candidates.md"
              >docs/architecture/score-v3-candidates.md</a
            ></span
          >
          <span data-i18n-show="en" hidden={lang !== 'en'}
            >Engineer notes — Score v3 candidate factors, measurement gate, GO/NO-GO record:{' '}
            <a
              href="https://github.com/jee1/ten_bagger/blob/main/docs/architecture/score-v3-candidates.md"
              >docs/architecture/score-v3-candidates.md</a
            ></span
          >
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
